        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0303e738-a5d2-42a7-8b46-e463dbacebb9",
      "name": "Sticky Note a57941f3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PF Real Booking Import\nReal-data test without a Calendly webhook on staging (AGENTS.md: no live ingestion on staging).\n\n1. Book the Calendly event type **Session follow-up demo** (host Aniol) with an invitee email `aniol.moner+something@n8n.io`.\n2. Click **Import Now**. It reads your events from 6 h ago to 14 days ahead (Aniol-Calendly-PAT, read only), keeps only the demo event type, and sends each booking to Darwin Sessions Ingest (Calendly) as a webhook body.\n3. Run again after a cancel or reschedule. Re-runs are safe: the ingest never resets follow-up fields.\n\nOther invitee emails are dropped here and in the ingest.",
        "color": 5
      }
    }
